  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-missing-ice-cube-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "2db6fa5981ac40c0c40619d46d4e899f582ac4c59e9bb38bb4f1ebbe99bebecb",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d692ae89ae09198954f642cf37ad63f895e8843dfa67636aa1f162d219feae3d",
      "text": "冰块失踪案",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5a00b615c9eabcb47c7575fcb2bc2e4272e08f7fcdfec666d35106b2b526107c",
      "text": "悟空从冷冻室拿出一块冰。\n哇，好冰！又冷又硬。\n他把冰块放在小托盘里。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d6b3b6c3c82cccb22786a94d72e6c51dae63765aec6ac5d8cfa3f9da178d606",
      "text": "悟空说：“你就当我的冰块船吧，\n我和敖丙给你做一面小旗！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94d007c989c43b195102f079d3be730a0588b8d432406250bf8949c11f4d1a06",
      "text": "悟空和敖丙一起画小旗，\n慢慢地、仔仔细细地涂颜色。\n这一画，就画了好久好久。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "630cde492994661f88912db4ff14924e6f51d6a4ac3dca0cdf5be9dbdae2721b",
      "text": "他举着小旗跑回来——\n冰块不见了！\n托盘里只有一小摊水和一点\n点小冰角。\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8c44341454517eaef8d31307e281df4fb42e7652fe87c95f8d48c2042dda74ee",
      "text": "悟空拿来放大镜：\n“是谁拿走了我的冰块？”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2121dd6d96d54d1f9297f92d5439280de6aa5dc1f86d415445939f0ef3c6543c",
      "text": "他找找桌子底下，\n找找水槽里面，\n连自己的鞋子里都找了！\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "64f003b1369a07fd5c04148c677045f1ab6716eda1e9925d2b0129bde60a97bd",
      "text": "敖丙凑近托盘仔细看：\n“这儿还有最后一点冰，\n它越变越小了。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a4da4ba661872a0ba7684fec5a37cc46df40190f80244100546b15a246926bd9",
      "text": "敖丙说：“厨房里暖和，\n冰一暖和，就化成了水。”\n冰块没有跑掉，它是变了样！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62c2f61cb216cfb25c3cd561708d11b016937e83af21d7f5d7d903d03984555a",
      "text": "他们一起盯着那一点小冰角。\n滴答……滴答……它慢慢\n化完了。\n现在全都是水了。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f82f858ced8fd094b49d8061930ce9d43331bd082d085e4e602f134d019a396",
      "text": "敖丙说：“冰是固体，可以拿\n在手里；\n水是液体，会流动。”\n悟空把托盘轻轻一歪，水就滑到\n了一边！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "264c3bf43dcdb79f4a086bb1f2b5368dbac4fd453d15f4a27e9e3f01dd6824f9",
      "text": "悟空问：“它还能变回冰吗？”\n沙僧说：“冻一冻就行。”\n他们把水倒进小鱼冰模里。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "462d081ebd75400bb8965da5978e943639b687ed91f0002289ee5196f07bdc3c",
      "text": "沙僧把冰模放进冷冻室，\n里面冷冰冰的。\n“现在要等一等，等到明天。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f26695edc568fd1e7648626637ca5c5d0da0a5164a3e47c6cf9021f5d1ac2427",
      "text": "那天晚上，悟空踮着脚走到\n冰箱前，\n小声说：“晚安，小水滴。”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "73b09bf2a2ff69371e0b853ea4a03886db7d521ebb4d52efbe25b4f4b794c7c4",
      "text": "第二天早上，他们打开冷冻室。\n水结成冰了！\n变成了一条小冰鱼。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a709d33a99cdeb43012a405bf8e641ee195ad6bf8571068c4b48bac02dff1a06",
      "text": "悟空说：“破案啦！”\n结案卡上画着：冰，水，又\n变回冰。\n沙僧把小冰鱼放回冷冻室，\n悟空收好放大镜，下次还要用。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
